<title>UK: TABLE-Amersham lifts year profits 30 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Amersham lifts year profits 30 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		63.8		   vs 53.2</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 22.0		   vs 18.0</p>
<p> Pretax		     65.8		   vs 50.8</p>
<p> Sales			426.4		  vs 351.4</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 66.5 and 64.0 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Amersham International Plc</p>
</text>
